#: lib/phoenix_kit_hello_world/web/components_live.ex:2555
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "pagination renders patch links, so the page needs a handle_params callback. A real list keeps the page size in the URL and resets to page 1 when it changes (core's UrlState does both); this demo holds it in assigns."
msgstr "pagination joonistab patch-linke, seega vajab leht handle_params tagasikutset. Päris loend hoiab lehe suurust URL-is ja lähtestab muutumisel lehe 1-le (core'i UrlState teeb mõlemat); see demo hoiab seda assigns'is."

#: lib/phoenix_kit_hello_world/web/components_live.ex:1664
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Cancel is a link with cancel_to, an event with cancel_click (add cancel_target inside a LiveComponent), or your own markup in the cancel slot — one of the three. submit_disabled greys the submit button; say why in submit_label, as the empty name does here."
msgstr "Tühistamine on link (cancel_to), sündmus (cancel_click; LiveComponent'i sees lisa cancel_target) või sinu enda märgistus cancel-pesas — üks kolmest. submit_disabled muudab saatmisnupu mitteaktiivseks; ütle submit_label'is, miks, nagu siin tühi nimi."

